{"name":"Blue Racer","hex":"#4ba4a9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue racer","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A subspecies of snake, Coluber constrictor foxii."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue_racer"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Blue Racer","blocks":[{"text":"The Blue Racer is a series of 17 theatrical cartoons produced from 1972 to 1974 created by Friz Freleng and David H. DePatie. The character's first cartoon, Snake in the Gracias, was released theatrically on January 24, 1971."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6b/Blueracercartoon.jpg/330px-Blueracercartoon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Blue_Racer","wikidata":"Q3074678"},{"title":"Coluber constrictor foxii","blocks":[{"text":"Coluber constrictor foxii, commonly known as the blue racer, is a subspecies of Coluber constrictor, a species of nonvenomous colubrid snake commonly referred to as the eastern racer."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Coiledblueracersnake.jpg/330px-Coiledblueracersnake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coluber_constrictor_foxii","wikidata":"Q5149505"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Blue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg/500px-Blue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Blue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg/1280px-Blue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Blue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg/500px-Blue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABlue_Racer_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_287649729_on_13_December_2024.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Blue_Racer%2C_Illinois%2C_US_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_442136077.jpg/500px-Blue_Racer%2C_Illinois%2C_US_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_442136077.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Blue_Racer%2C_Illinois%2C_US_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_442136077.jpg/1280px-Blue_Racer%2C_Illinois%2C_US_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_442136077.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Blue_Racer%2C_Illinois%2C_US_imported_from_iNaturalist_photo_442136077.jpg/500p